WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:41.000 --> 01:44.202
=Episode 11=

01:45.288 --> 01:46.488
So you were classmates.

01:48.688 --> 01:50.568
I didn't expect you two
to know each other.

01:51.208 --> 01:52.688
Officer Hu is practically my savior.

01:53.367 --> 01:54.167
Really?

01:54.648 --> 01:55.967
No, he's joking.

01:56.807 --> 01:57.327
Huan'er,

01:57.967 --> 02:00.967
were you and Mr. Gao here
for dinner today?

02:01.648 --> 02:03.087
We came here to discuss work.

02:05.327 --> 02:06.167
What about you?

02:07.967 --> 02:09.088
He asked me out to dinner.

02:09.167 --> 02:10.248
So I reserved here.

02:13.047 --> 02:13.727
Well,

02:13.727 --> 02:14.848
we actually sat down.

02:15.047 --> 02:16.688
I just remembered
we have something else.

02:16.688 --> 02:18.288
Mr. Gao and I shouldn't disturb you.

02:18.288 --> 02:18.808
We'll leave.

02:18.808 --> 02:19.327
It's fine.

02:19.327 --> 02:19.968
Wait a moment.

02:20.848 --> 02:23.008
Old classmates getting together

02:23.008 --> 02:23.688
is rare.

02:23.688 --> 02:24.528
Why not catch up?

02:25.047 --> 02:26.008
I'd like to hear it too.

02:27.568 --> 02:29.568
What's there for us three
to catch up about?

02:30.288 --> 02:34.568
School memories are just exams,
pressure, and things like that.

02:35.447 --> 02:36.568
I won't even mention them.

02:37.128 --> 02:38.368
I'm actually quite nostalgic.

02:38.968 --> 02:40.008
You, me, Mengmeng,

02:40.047 --> 02:41.047
- and...
- Since childhood...

02:42.288 --> 02:43.688
We've been friends since childhood.

02:44.128 --> 02:47.248
We had plenty of happy memories
back in high school.

02:47.688 --> 02:49.688
I remember
we always skipped class together,

02:49.688 --> 02:50.568
read romance novels,

02:50.568 --> 02:52.447
climbed over walls,
passed notes, and so on.

02:52.767 --> 02:55.447
Nonsense. We never did any of that.

02:57.568 --> 02:59.248
But passing notes? You and Ou...

03:00.767 --> 03:02.167
Oh, I remembered wrong.

03:06.167 --> 03:07.047
Let's skip me.

03:08.688 --> 03:09.688
Stop talking about me.

03:09.688 --> 03:11.128
Let's talk about you and Tiehan.

03:12.088 --> 03:13.288
I remember in high school,

03:13.288 --> 03:15.848
didn't Tiehan... for you...

03:16.327 --> 03:17.327
for you...

03:17.327 --> 03:18.727
He got into a fight for me once.

03:18.727 --> 03:21.128
Yes, he fought for you, right?

03:21.848 --> 03:22.767
We were friends.

03:23.088 --> 03:24.688
Of course I'd step up.

03:26.447 --> 03:27.248
Let's eat.

03:32.327 --> 03:35.368
So you three were a squad?

03:35.887 --> 03:37.207
Was it just the three of you?

03:37.207 --> 03:38.047
Anyone else?

03:38.047 --> 03:38.927
There was one more.

03:39.088 --> 03:40.767
And dear Mr. Gao too.

03:41.248 --> 03:44.047
Mr. Gao, you are now my best friend.

03:44.408 --> 03:45.288
Let me toast you.

03:45.647 --> 03:47.248
I hope in the future,
in terms of work...

03:51.487 --> 03:52.848
T-Thank you, Mr. Gao.

04:05.288 --> 04:06.968
Mr. Gao, let me toast you.

04:07.207 --> 04:08.727
Huan'er actually

04:08.727 --> 04:10.207
works really hard.

04:10.288 --> 04:11.767
Please be patient with her.

04:12.767 --> 04:13.568
Allow me.

04:16.967 --> 04:17.568
Mr. Gao.

04:18.207 --> 04:18.928
Thank you.

04:22.488 --> 04:24.847
D-Drink less.

04:43.647 --> 04:45.248
No need. I'm fine.

04:45.248 --> 04:46.488
Let me help you walk.

04:46.488 --> 04:47.847
I'm really fine.

04:49.327 --> 04:50.488
What's wrong with you?

04:50.488 --> 04:51.327
Look at you.

04:53.407 --> 04:55.447
You're usually so aloof.

04:56.287 --> 04:58.688
Why are you being so childish
when you're upset?

04:59.847 --> 05:02.407
You shouldn't be so stubborn.

05:03.488 --> 05:04.207
People might think

05:04.207 --> 05:05.847
I'm bullying you.

05:09.407 --> 05:10.928
It's not you bullying me.

05:12.008 --> 05:13.407
I'm making it hard for myself.

05:14.688 --> 05:16.128
Drunk and still talking back.

05:17.248 --> 05:18.447
Then tell me.

05:19.128 --> 05:20.767
How are you making it hard for yourself?

05:23.048 --> 05:24.168
Or should I

05:24.168 --> 05:25.568
make it hard for you instead?

05:38.608 --> 05:41.087
You've been picking on me
for the past few days.

05:41.767 --> 05:42.767
Are you jealous?

05:47.647 --> 05:48.407
Gao Haiming?

05:50.447 --> 05:51.048
Mr. Gao?

05:51.048 --> 05:51.847
What?

05:53.808 --> 05:54.608
Ignoring me?

05:55.688 --> 05:56.688
Or perhaps

05:59.248 --> 06:00.087
you like me?

06:00.207 --> 06:01.128
Not at all.

06:02.287 --> 06:03.447
Still denying it?

06:03.688 --> 06:05.527
You're not being honest with yourself.

06:10.008 --> 06:10.887
Come on, look at me.

06:11.327 --> 06:11.847
What?

06:11.847 --> 06:12.887
- Look at me.
- What?

06:12.887 --> 06:13.688
Look at me.

06:14.608 --> 06:15.407
Question time.

06:15.488 --> 06:17.608
Choose one of these two emotions.

06:17.887 --> 06:20.087
This one means you're jealous.

06:21.407 --> 06:23.967
And this one means you like me.

06:24.767 --> 06:25.608
Which one?

06:29.688 --> 06:30.407
Can I not choose?

06:30.407 --> 06:31.847
No, you must choose one.

06:44.608 --> 06:45.168
Fine.

06:49.488 --> 06:50.447
Then I choose...

06:52.128 --> 06:53.008
I choose...

07:11.608 --> 07:12.488
The third option.

07:13.087 --> 07:13.767
I hate you.

07:15.688 --> 07:16.688
You hate me?

07:17.287 --> 07:19.168
How could you possibly hate me?

07:19.568 --> 07:21.887
You went through all that trouble
to keep me close.

07:21.887 --> 07:24.168
You're pushing it
by making me your special assistant,

07:24.168 --> 07:25.608
having me come see you every day.

07:25.608 --> 07:27.688
Given all the time you spend,
you clearly like me.

07:27.688 --> 07:28.568
You can't hate me.

07:28.568 --> 07:30.407
Why are you so talkative today?

07:33.168 --> 07:34.168
Alright.

07:34.928 --> 07:38.327
I'll stop talking now, lips sealed.

07:57.207 --> 07:57.928
Alright.

08:08.568 --> 08:10.207
Alright. Don't be mad.

08:18.216 --> 08:22.056
♪Old photos, yellowed♪

08:22.056 --> 08:26.047
♪Timelines, tangled♪

08:26.696 --> 08:30.008
♪I boarded a rickety time machine♪

08:30.008 --> 08:32.608
I've got to say, hair this stubborn

08:32.887 --> 08:34.368
paired with your competitive streak

08:34.608 --> 08:35.687
is truly irritating.

08:37.896 --> 08:42.008
♪In memories, the breeze is soft♪

08:42.008 --> 08:43.047
I don't buy it.

08:46.632 --> 08:51.942
♪Lighting up my lonely corner♪

08:58.608 --> 08:59.608
You're so childish.

09:00.887 --> 09:01.640
Not your concern.

09:36.448 --> 09:37.008
Hello?

09:37.248 --> 09:38.448
Good morning, Mr. Gao.

09:38.527 --> 09:39.927
You have visitors scheduled today.

09:39.927 --> 09:42.287
To stay on schedule,
you should get up now.

09:44.728 --> 09:45.887
Got it.

09:49.287 --> 09:51.527
Choose one of these two emotions.

09:51.647 --> 09:53.968
This one means you're jealous.

09:55.167 --> 09:57.767
And this one means you like me.

10:05.047 --> 10:06.128
Lin Huan'er, you...

10:06.448 --> 10:07.368
Hello, sir.

10:07.527 --> 10:09.047
This is City Voice radio.

10:09.248 --> 10:11.248
We're calling to inform you

10:11.248 --> 10:14.248
the requested song for Ms. Lin Huan'er
by you last night is selected.

10:14.848 --> 10:16.328
It's for a woman I hate very much.

10:17.927 --> 10:18.848
Her name's Lin Huan'er.

10:19.167 --> 10:21.448
It'll air
during our noon broadcast today.

10:22.248 --> 10:25.088
Well, can I cancel this song request?

10:25.488 --> 10:27.208
Sorry, the schedule has been finalized.

10:27.208 --> 10:28.008
No adjustments.

10:28.128 --> 10:31.968
C-Could it air in the evening
or late night instead?

10:32.407 --> 10:33.328
We sincerely apologize.

10:33.328 --> 10:34.647
We've locked in the programming.

10:34.767 --> 10:36.407
The timing and content can't be changed.

10:36.567 --> 10:37.448
Please understand.

10:38.887 --> 10:40.887
Alright then, thanks.

10:50.887 --> 10:51.407
Hello?

10:51.968 --> 10:53.767
Mr. Gao, I'm downstairs at your place.

10:54.287 --> 10:54.848
Got it.

10:56.647 --> 10:58.968
Mr. Gao, I have news
on that matter you asked about.

10:59.728 --> 11:01.968
Ou Xiaojue cheated
right after arriving in the UK.

11:01.968 --> 11:03.088
What a scumbag.

11:06.687 --> 11:08.848
Mr. Gao, how are you feeling?

11:15.647 --> 11:16.968
When will they return to China?

11:18.407 --> 11:20.047
Around 2 PM this Sunday.

11:21.968 --> 11:24.567
Mr. Gao, should I arrange for Miss Lin

11:25.448 --> 11:27.728
to go with me
to pick you up at the airport?

11:28.848 --> 11:30.527
You're getting smarter by the day.

11:31.488 --> 11:33.047
You taught me well, Mr. Gao.

11:33.448 --> 11:34.448
I'm not that free.

11:34.647 --> 11:35.287
Get out.

11:40.728 --> 11:41.488
Hold on.

11:43.167 --> 11:45.088
I recall you mentioning last time

11:45.407 --> 11:48.767
that you have a friend
at Bozhou Radio and Television Station.

11:48.767 --> 11:49.608
Is he still there?

11:50.008 --> 11:51.368
H-He's still there.

11:53.088 --> 11:56.287
Well, I have a friend

11:56.647 --> 11:57.927
who got drunk last night.

12:00.248 --> 12:04.608
So that friend of yours feels a bit shy

12:04.608 --> 12:06.128
and doesn't want his confession

12:06.128 --> 12:10.008
to be overheard by Lin...
or all kinds of people, right?

12:10.608 --> 12:11.968
Just tell me if it's doable.

12:14.527 --> 12:15.807
I'll give it a shot.

12:16.728 --> 12:17.647
Consider it done.

12:23.647 --> 12:25.608
(Mr. Gao, recovered from the hangover?)

12:25.848 --> 12:27.128
(What's on today's agenda?)

12:27.128 --> 12:28.287
(I'll pick you up at home.)

12:31.968 --> 12:33.448
I'm not going to work today.

12:35.448 --> 12:37.407
But you have three meetings
this afternoon.

12:37.407 --> 12:38.848
You must go to work today.

12:40.208 --> 12:43.527
Or I could assign Miss Lin to fieldwork

12:44.047 --> 12:45.328
if you don't want to see her.

12:49.448 --> 12:50.504
(Letao Tower)

12:54.687 --> 12:55.328
Mr. Gao.

13:02.088 --> 13:02.687
Boss,

13:02.968 --> 13:04.448
over here. Morning.

13:15.167 --> 13:16.848
I made some grape juice for you.

13:16.848 --> 13:18.527
Perfect for post-hangover recovery.

13:20.088 --> 13:20.647
No need.

13:21.767 --> 13:23.848
From now on,
delegate assistant duties to Luo.

13:24.767 --> 13:25.968
Return to your original role.

13:31.647 --> 13:34.647
Did I do something wrong?

13:35.047 --> 13:40.647
No, it's just... you've got
more important things to handle.

13:40.647 --> 13:41.407
What things?

13:44.647 --> 13:45.407
You'll see.

13:46.088 --> 13:48.248
I have things to do.
You should get back to work.

13:51.167 --> 13:51.887
I see.

13:54.767 --> 13:57.208
You meant what you said last night.

13:57.527 --> 13:58.328
I understand.

13:58.968 --> 13:59.608
Wait.

14:00.328 --> 14:01.328
Which part?

14:03.647 --> 14:04.968
Drunk words are sober thoughts.

14:04.968 --> 14:05.767
I understand.

14:06.647 --> 14:07.407
Hold on.

14:08.448 --> 14:09.287
Which part?

14:10.848 --> 14:12.407
Drink the grape juice. I'm leaving.

14:47.728 --> 14:48.527
Put this coat on.

14:49.008 --> 14:50.848
I'm fine. I don't want it.

14:51.208 --> 14:53.008
Do you think I'm drunk?

14:53.647 --> 14:54.448
No.

14:54.608 --> 14:57.527
I just had a couple extra drinks
with that Mr. Gao.

14:57.527 --> 15:01.167
I was just worried
he might bully Huan'er at the company.

15:09.287 --> 15:10.047
Look.

15:10.767 --> 15:12.887
Silly Goose, look here.

15:12.887 --> 15:17.208
Doesn't this look like the road
from school when you walked me home?

15:18.807 --> 15:19.647
Tell me.

15:19.848 --> 15:24.287
Why was the school
so close to my home back then?

15:24.767 --> 15:26.088
So close.

15:26.728 --> 15:31.287
We'd arrive
before I could even finish a few jokes.

15:38.208 --> 15:39.407
You...

15:41.848 --> 15:44.208
Why did you stop walking me home later?

15:44.848 --> 15:45.647
Why?

15:47.488 --> 15:50.167
You got a car right after graduation.

15:51.088 --> 15:52.088
Because of that?

16:02.527 --> 16:05.527
I won't drive anymore.

16:09.287 --> 16:11.407
Why was it so close?

16:12.128 --> 16:13.407
Why?

16:31.647 --> 16:32.328
Hello?

16:32.687 --> 16:34.728
Miss Mengmeng, don't forget to come sign

16:34.728 --> 16:36.488
the Star and Firefly contract
this afternoon.

16:55.728 --> 16:56.527
Where to, miss?

16:56.807 --> 16:57.407
Get in.

16:57.407 --> 16:58.328
I'll charge you less.

16:58.608 --> 16:59.848
We can negotiate the price.

17:00.208 --> 17:01.687
No thanks, I already called a cab.

17:02.767 --> 17:03.848
I can lower the price.

17:04.127 --> 17:04.968
What do you say?

17:15.928 --> 17:17.648
Hello, I'm with Bozhou Traffic Police.

17:18.287 --> 17:19.248
Your driver's license.

17:19.248 --> 17:19.767
Okay.

17:20.648 --> 17:21.527
Here you are.

17:22.127 --> 17:23.327
Do you have a taxi permit?

17:24.208 --> 17:25.807
N-No.

17:26.287 --> 17:29.047
You know illegal ride-hailing here
is against the law, right?

17:29.527 --> 17:30.208
Understood.

17:30.448 --> 17:31.767
I won't do it ever again.

17:31.928 --> 17:33.008
Go pay your fine later.

17:33.087 --> 17:34.008
Got it.

17:38.287 --> 17:40.168
Silly Goose, what are you doing here?

17:42.767 --> 17:43.968
Heading somewhere?

17:44.607 --> 17:45.688
The publishing house.

17:45.688 --> 17:46.888
I'm almost late.

17:46.888 --> 17:47.928
Could you give me a ride?

17:49.047 --> 17:49.767
Hop on.

18:36.287 --> 18:37.408
Thanks for today.

18:37.648 --> 18:39.208
When my car is fixed,

18:39.208 --> 18:40.367
let's go out together.

18:40.367 --> 18:41.008
No problem.

18:42.408 --> 18:43.847
Didn't you say you wouldn't drive?

18:46.408 --> 18:47.648
Not anymore?

18:48.327 --> 18:52.047
Well, maybe only occasionally
on holidays.

18:53.327 --> 18:53.928
Bye.

18:58.047 --> 18:58.728
Bye.

19:11.567 --> 19:13.567
(Bozhou Jinghao Shooting Range)
Isn't this the one near my place?

19:16.008 --> 19:18.488
Silly Goose said
not to drive on holidays.

19:19.928 --> 19:22.047
Meaning he will be my driver?

19:25.767 --> 19:28.928
(Thank you for listening
to FM98.1, dear audience.)

19:29.527 --> 19:30.567
(Next is a song from...)

19:30.607 --> 19:31.448
Hello, Mr. Gao.

19:31.728 --> 19:32.728
(He requested this song)

19:32.728 --> 19:35.008
(to express his feelings
for the one he likes.)

19:35.448 --> 19:36.767
(He wants to tell Miss Wu,)

19:36.928 --> 19:39.408
("I wish to have your heart
and grow old together.")

19:39.888 --> 19:42.648
(A lot of love songs on the list today.)

19:42.648 --> 19:44.208
Why listen to the radio at work?

19:45.968 --> 19:48.448
Developing products needs
prior coordination with advertisers.

19:48.847 --> 19:51.208
I'm selecting channels for research.

19:51.567 --> 19:53.047
I've already shortlisted several.

19:53.047 --> 19:53.767
No need.

19:54.928 --> 19:55.688
Do something else.

20:03.168 --> 20:05.127
Go to Dr. Wei's lab

20:05.287 --> 20:07.047
and check on the materials R&amp;D progress.

20:10.168 --> 20:10.807
Wait.

20:12.047 --> 20:12.767
Why me?

20:38.504 --> 20:40.717
Mr. Gao, your meeting
with the production line supplier

20:40.717 --> 20:42.047
is at 2 PM today.

20:42.767 --> 20:45.047
Also, I've sent Lin Huan'er
to Dr. Wei's lab.

20:48.648 --> 20:49.448
How will she go?

20:50.928 --> 20:51.648
By taxi.

20:55.087 --> 20:55.767
Lin Huan'er.

20:57.527 --> 20:58.327
Lin Huan'er.

21:00.807 --> 21:01.287
Mr. Gao?

21:01.287 --> 21:03.008
(Hello, dear listeners.)

21:03.248 --> 21:04.488
(This is FM...)

21:04.488 --> 21:05.367
Get out first.

21:05.928 --> 21:07.767
I have a meeting with Dr. Wei.

21:07.767 --> 21:09.327
It'll be too late if I don't go soon.

21:11.208 --> 21:11.928
I'll drive you.

21:19.688 --> 21:21.928
Is there a problem
with the materials R&amp;D?

21:21.928 --> 21:23.527
Does it require you to go personally?

21:30.648 --> 21:32.047
Where's the radio switch?

21:32.168 --> 21:32.688
It's broken.

21:34.168 --> 21:34.928
It's broken?

21:36.287 --> 21:38.208
I wanted to listen to City Voice.

21:38.807 --> 21:40.208
That program is really well done.

21:40.648 --> 21:42.408
It suits our product's vibe perfectly.

21:42.648 --> 21:43.928
My research isn't finished yet.

21:44.287 --> 21:45.047
Now it's broken.

21:45.287 --> 21:45.928
Not necessary.

21:50.527 --> 21:52.208
Why are you acting so strange today?

21:54.327 --> 21:54.928
Am I?

21:55.567 --> 21:56.208
You are.

22:01.168 --> 22:03.008
This isn't the way to the lab.

22:06.287 --> 22:07.287
I'm taking you to relax

22:07.287 --> 22:08.047
and get inspired.

22:12.807 --> 22:16.047
So... all this
was just to take me on a date?

22:20.807 --> 22:22.688
Consider it working from elsewhere.

22:25.327 --> 22:29.208
Then can I choose somewhere
comfortable and inspiring to work?

22:30.327 --> 22:31.168
Like where?

22:33.327 --> 22:34.208
Coastal Park.

22:36.408 --> 22:37.287
The seaside?

22:38.888 --> 22:40.888
Mengmeng mentioned
there's a market there.

22:41.208 --> 22:42.127
I want to check it out.

22:48.807 --> 22:49.488
Alright.

22:50.047 --> 22:50.807
To the seaside.

22:57.408 --> 22:59.968
The sea. I want to see the sea.

23:00.767 --> 23:02.087
The estuary counts as the sea?

23:02.688 --> 23:04.527
Yes, it does. Pull over up front.

23:20.248 --> 23:22.488
Sea, here I come.

23:37.127 --> 23:38.408
What are you doing? Come over.

23:41.287 --> 23:43.408
(Mom! Mom!)

23:47.287 --> 23:50.527
What? Is the suit inconvenient
for sea viewing?

23:54.168 --> 23:56.248
Mr. Gao, I've heard

23:56.807 --> 23:58.488
wishes made to the sea work well.

23:58.847 --> 23:59.807
Won't you try?

24:03.567 --> 24:04.327
Let's go.

24:05.047 --> 24:06.047
Let's go look.

24:06.767 --> 24:08.208
Don't you have any wishes?

24:12.648 --> 24:13.527
Make wishes here.

24:20.648 --> 24:23.888
(Mom! Mom, help!)

24:23.968 --> 24:25.208
Oh great sea,

24:26.888 --> 24:27.928
please let me go back.

24:29.607 --> 24:31.127
I really miss home.

24:38.567 --> 24:40.448
Let me go back soon. I'm begging you.

24:40.527 --> 24:42.527
Thank you. Thank you.

24:43.928 --> 24:44.807
Are you done?

24:47.567 --> 24:48.208
Are you cold?

24:49.168 --> 24:49.688
No.

24:54.047 --> 24:55.008
You're afraid of water?

25:16.408 --> 25:18.168
Stop looking. Let's go.

25:34.208 --> 25:36.104
Are you afraid of water
because you can't swim?

25:37.928 --> 25:39.208
Did you drown as a kid?

25:40.448 --> 25:42.168
Why do you want
to know so much about me?

25:42.648 --> 25:44.168
It's better to know both sides.

25:44.408 --> 25:47.928
To cooperate better
at work in the future,

25:47.928 --> 25:49.208
I need to lay the groundwork.

25:52.327 --> 25:53.168
Feeling better now?

25:53.488 --> 25:56.168
I thought you were going to talk work
with that sour face forever?

26:02.047 --> 26:03.336
I'm not talking work with you.

26:04.688 --> 26:06.607
Are we talking about feelings then?

26:09.408 --> 26:10.008
Sure.

26:12.807 --> 26:13.567
Answer me.

26:13.928 --> 26:17.047
Who are you working
so tirelessly and persistently for?

26:20.008 --> 26:21.008
For money.

26:38.408 --> 26:39.168
What is it?

26:46.648 --> 26:47.367
Got it.

26:48.168 --> 26:48.968
I'll be back soon.

26:50.327 --> 26:51.008
What's wrong?

26:52.888 --> 26:53.488
Nothing.

26:54.168 --> 26:56.888
Just a problem with the equipment
on the production line.

26:57.928 --> 26:59.968
The supplier we had a deal with
just backed out.

27:01.527 --> 27:03.127
Fuchuang's doing again?

27:04.408 --> 27:05.168
Not sure yet.

27:05.567 --> 27:06.767
But if the equipment fails,

27:07.047 --> 27:09.408
the whole production line will halt.

27:10.367 --> 27:13.168
And the raw materials we ordered
for after New Year will pile up.

27:14.008 --> 27:15.127
Is there a contingency plan?

27:18.952 --> 27:20.688
We have backups
in Switzerland and Italy.

27:20.807 --> 27:22.287
But we still need a final screening.

27:22.847 --> 27:23.567
(Italy?)

27:24.127 --> 27:24.728
(Right.)

27:24.767 --> 27:27.047
(He'll bring back 33 cans of air
from Italy.)

27:27.208 --> 27:29.488
(A turning point in his relationship
with Lin Huan'er.)

27:29.488 --> 27:30.607
No need to compare.

27:30.688 --> 27:31.767
Choose the Italian one.

27:37.208 --> 27:40.408
But the Italian one costs 3% more
than the current one.

27:40.807 --> 27:41.807
Even if we can secure it,

27:41.807 --> 27:43.208
the profit margin will be very low.

27:43.527 --> 27:44.607
Forget about the board.

27:44.607 --> 27:45.928
I won't even get past my dad.

27:46.847 --> 27:48.087
Don't worry about that for now.

27:48.168 --> 27:49.208
Secure it first.

27:49.408 --> 27:51.567
Although this one
has higher upfront costs,

27:51.928 --> 27:53.888
it's beneficial
for long-term development later.

27:54.248 --> 27:54.928
Trust me.

27:58.367 --> 27:59.127
Another prophecy?

27:59.847 --> 28:02.648
No, this time it's fate's choice.

28:38.008 --> 28:40.567
Mr. Gao, do you believe in fate?

28:42.527 --> 28:45.567
I think your trip to Italy this time
is fated.

28:47.648 --> 28:48.208
Boss,

28:48.327 --> 28:50.047
your flights and hotel
have been arranged.

28:50.047 --> 28:50.648
All the best.

28:50.648 --> 28:51.648
We'll be waiting for you.

28:52.567 --> 28:53.248
Safe travels.

28:54.008 --> 28:54.648
Bye.

29:46.928 --> 29:48.287
(He should be returning today.)

29:53.408 --> 29:54.888
Slow down. Tell me what's wrong.

29:56.287 --> 29:57.567
Okay, I'll call now.

29:59.287 --> 30:00.807
We don't have specific details yet.

30:01.287 --> 30:02.408
The plane has lost contact.

30:02.408 --> 30:04.567
I heard it's been out of contact
for over two hours.

30:04.567 --> 30:07.168
The airline is urgently searching
for the plane's signal.

30:07.408 --> 30:08.408
Was there an accident?

30:08.408 --> 30:09.408
Hard to tell.

30:09.408 --> 30:11.047
Crashes often start with lost contact.

30:11.047 --> 30:11.688
And then...

30:12.567 --> 30:13.767
Don't jinx it, alright?

30:13.767 --> 30:14.408
Exactly.

30:17.168 --> 30:17.807
Luo.

30:19.168 --> 30:19.968
We'll talk later.

30:20.287 --> 30:21.408
What exactly happened?

30:21.688 --> 30:25.888
Mr. Gao's return flight from Italy today
has been out of contact.

30:32.287 --> 30:33.047
Sorry.

30:33.287 --> 30:35.968
The number you dialed
cannot be reached for the moment.

30:43.728 --> 30:44.408
Sorry.

30:44.847 --> 30:47.168
The number you dialed
cannot be reached for the moment.

30:49.807 --> 30:52.047
The chairman has used connections
to reach the airline.

30:52.047 --> 30:53.968
We'll be notified immediately
once there's news.

30:57.208 --> 30:58.648
(The system gave me no alert.)

30:58.648 --> 30:59.767
(He's definitely safe.)

31:01.047 --> 31:02.087
(No way he's in danger.)

31:03.087 --> 31:04.168
(He's the male lead.)

31:04.168 --> 31:05.327
(He can't be written off.)

31:06.047 --> 31:06.607
Luo,

31:06.607 --> 31:08.567
there's an issue
with the production line now.

31:08.928 --> 31:10.408
We can't reach the supplier.

31:12.928 --> 31:14.807
I'm sure
nothing has happened to Mr. Gao.

31:15.567 --> 31:16.688
Everyone, stay calm.

31:17.287 --> 31:19.688
Let's not panic before we get results.

31:19.767 --> 31:20.968
Proceed as normal for now.

31:21.448 --> 31:23.287
Yes. Everyone, return to work.

31:23.287 --> 31:25.168
I'll go to the airport.
Call me if needed.

31:25.287 --> 31:26.168
I'll go with you.

31:36.248 --> 31:37.767
Luo, what's the situation on your end?

31:38.327 --> 31:40.168
The airport says
the flight is still missing.

31:40.567 --> 31:41.408
What about your side?

31:41.567 --> 31:43.448
The airline wants us
to keep waiting for now.

31:43.448 --> 31:44.688
They're still verifying.

31:44.928 --> 31:46.327
It's okay. Let's not lose hope yet.

31:46.567 --> 31:47.448
Let's wait for now.

31:48.807 --> 31:50.287
Then we'll split up and ask around.

31:50.567 --> 31:51.168
Okay.

32:07.408 --> 32:10.168
(You're the male lead.
You'll definitely be fine.)

32:15.688 --> 32:16.448
Lin Huan'er.

32:17.608 --> 32:20.591
♪Entwined worries linger♪

32:21.800 --> 32:24.571
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

32:26.472 --> 32:32.385
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

32:34.182 --> 32:37.242
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

32:38.408 --> 32:41.860
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

32:42.856 --> 32:48.382
♪Until the world's end♪

32:52.287 --> 32:52.968
What's wrong?

32:53.928 --> 32:57.367
(Flight KS107 from Milan to Bozhou)

32:57.367 --> 32:59.527
(lost contact
due to communication failure.)

32:59.567 --> 33:00.567
(It's now located.)

33:00.648 --> 33:03.448
(It's expected to arrive
at this airport in 12 minutes.)

33:07.688 --> 33:08.928
You didn't think I...

33:09.448 --> 33:10.767
I'm just glad you're back safely.

33:14.688 --> 33:15.688
I changed my flight.

33:17.327 --> 33:18.208
Sorry to worry you.

33:20.807 --> 33:21.607
Congratulations.

33:21.807 --> 33:23.847
You've successfully completed Quest Two

33:23.847 --> 33:25.248
and gained Male Lead's affection.

33:25.567 --> 33:27.448
His current fondness toward you: 60%.

33:27.807 --> 33:29.607
Now keep going, Player.

33:29.607 --> 33:30.728
Complete the final quest

33:30.847 --> 33:32.287
by achieving 100% fondness

33:32.408 --> 33:33.367
and getting proposed to.

33:33.688 --> 33:35.567
May you return to your world soon.

33:36.968 --> 33:37.888
What's wrong?

33:38.928 --> 33:39.567
Nothing.

33:44.767 --> 33:45.567
This is for you.

33:47.208 --> 33:47.928
What is it?

33:50.567 --> 33:52.087
Don't open it yet.

33:53.327 --> 33:55.567
Open it at the right moment.

33:56.327 --> 33:58.527
When's the right moment?

33:59.168 --> 34:00.287
It's...

34:01.168 --> 34:01.968
Gao Haiming?

34:03.688 --> 34:04.408
Die'en?

34:04.567 --> 34:05.448
Long time no see.

34:05.448 --> 34:06.688
Long time no see.

34:06.688 --> 34:07.448
Long time no see.

34:11.768 --> 34:13.488
Let me introduce you. Xiaojue.

34:20.753 --> 34:23.736
♪Entwined worries linger♪

34:24.945 --> 34:27.716
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

34:29.617 --> 34:35.530
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

34:37.327 --> 34:40.387
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

34:41.553 --> 34:45.005
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

34:46.001 --> 34:51.527
♪Until the world's end♪

34:53.937 --> 34:57.733
♪If I could♪

34:58.321 --> 35:01.137
♪Keep loving you♪

35:02.161 --> 35:04.561
♪Hearing two hearts♪

35:04.561 --> 35:09.477
♪Beating together♪

35:10.449 --> 35:14.313
♪If I could♪

35:14.313 --> 35:17.553
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

35:18.609 --> 35:25.934
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

35:26.993 --> 35:29.937
